      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Eyi nshinta wabulilaŋa kuvwala anyana, imbaku tumina. Eyi wabulilaŋa kutiya nyisoŋu yakuvwala anyana, baluka kunakwimba tumina, dikuwi, muloŋa anyana kamumbanda analekuwu akabadika anyana kamumbanda wasumbuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toheshaku mwiluŋa detentideyi atandumuni mahina akudekawu kuwashakama. Bayi wanakenaku, leheshaku nyonji yeyi, koleshaku mpopu jeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa wakatanda nikuchikasa chachidiilu nikuchikasa chachimunswa. Anyaneyi akahetanyuza, akatuŋisha cheŋi antu munyikala yadiŋi kwamahembi hohu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wutiyaloŋa womaku, muloŋa eyi hiwakatiya nsonyi hela kubayaku, muloŋa hiyakakutiyisha nsonyuku, muloŋa wakavulamena nsonyi jahawukwenzi weyi, nikusawuka kwahawutuluwa weyi hiwakawanuka nawacheŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakutuŋili diyi nfumweyi, ijina dindi diyi Yehova wamazaza. Wajila waIsarela diyi nkúuli yeyi, akamutenaŋa nawu, Nzambi wesekidejima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Nyayihuŋu akumpulawu nampweji, abula kukundejawu, tiya, nukwala maloleyi awulombu wawuwahi weŋi naweŋa, nakatuŋa yikuku yeyi natusafira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakatuŋa njanina jeyi namarubi, niyenzelu yeyi yakumpwembu nakayituŋa namalola akeji keji, nipinza yeyi yejima nakayituŋa namalola akutiyisha kuwaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyaneyi ejima akekala alejewa kudi Yehova; kuwunda kwakamonawu anyaneyi kwakasweja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakashimata mukuloŋa, wakemana hahalehi nekabisha, muloŋa hiwakatiya womaku. Mutentu nawawakawimena hahalehi, muloŋa hiwakenza kwakwihi naneyuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya, kupompa akapompa, ilaŋa dinu hichakuyipompesha kudamuku. Akakukumaŋena akadimboka hamaseki, akakooleyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya, yami naleŋeli muchi wazakasaŋa kesi kamakala, wedishaŋa chitwa chamudimu windi. Yami naleŋeli mukwakunoŋesha kulonda anoŋeshaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hikwakekala chitwa, chakachilawu nawu akukatishi nachu, chakakolaku. Madimi ejima akakunyamukila nawu akusompeshi, wakayitanyisha. Weniwu diwuwuswana wawambuŋaYehova, nikuloŋa kwawu kunafumi kudami. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
